        {
          "content": "<p>由于清洁工人大罢工，巴黎街头本周到处堆积着一袋袋垃圾，行人在其中穿行。如果没人清理垃圾，现代都市可以支撑几天？（<a href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2023/03/11/europe/paris-trash-strikes-intl/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">via</a>）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "via",
              "url": "https://edition.cnn.com/2023/03/11/europe/paris-trash-strikes-intl/index.html"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
